LAMMPS (30 Sep 2026 - Update 1)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# LAMMPS side of the CFD-DEM lid driven cavity (read by Goma through "LAMMPS Input File").
#
# 2D granular disks in the unit square, same coordinates as the Goma mesh.
# Do NOT define the fix external here: Goma creates "fix cfd_drag all external pf/callback 1 1"
# and sets the timestep and runs LAMMPS itself (n_sub = ceil(goma dt / DEM Max Timestep)).

units           si
dimension       2
atom_style      sphere
atom_modify     map array
boundary        f f p
newton          off
comm_modify     vel yes

region          box block 0.0 1.0 0.0 1.0 -0.5 0.5
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.5) to (1 1 0.5)
  4 by 2 by 1 MPI processor grid

# 73 x 73 square lattice, spacing 0.0125, sites at 0.05 ... 0.95 (5329 disks)
lattice         sq 0.0125
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 0.0125 0.0125 0.0125
region          cloud block 0.049 0.951 0.049 0.951 -0.5 0.5 units box
create_atoms    1 region cloud
Created 5329 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.5) to (1 1 0.5)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

# disks: d = 0.003 (mesh h = 0.01 is ~3.3 d), areal density 2.5 (fluid density is 1)
# solid area fraction 4.5 %, about the same as the coarse case
set             type 1 diameter 0.003
Setting atom values ...
  5329 settings made for diameter
set             type 1 density/disc 2.5
Setting atom values ...
  5329 settings made for density/disc
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0

# spring-dashpot contacts. Not scaled down with particle mass: on the fine mesh the
# -V_p grad p force near the lid corners pushes disks through soft walls (kn = 8 lost a disk
# at t = 0.32). kn = 500 gives a collision time ~6e-4, resolved by the 2.5e-5 DEM step
# ("DEM Max Timestep" in input), with overlaps of a few percent of d.
pair_style      gran/hooke/history 500.0 NULL 5.0 NULL 0.5 0
pair_coeff      * *
neighbor        0.001 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0

fix             wallx all wall/gran hooke/history 500.0 NULL 5.0 NULL 0.5 0 xplane 0.0 1.0
fix             wally all wall/gran hooke/history 500.0 NULL 5.0 NULL 0.5 0 yplane 0.0 1.0
fix             integrate all nve/sphere disc
fix             twod all enforce2d

compute         ke all ke
thermo_style    custom step time atoms c_ke
thermo          4000

dump            parts all custom 2000 dump.particles id x y vx vy radius
dump_modify     parts sort id time yes
fix cfd_drag all external pf/callback 1 1
reset_timestep 0 time 0
timestep 2.5000000000000001e-05
run 40 pre yes post no
Generated 0 of 0 mixed pair_coeff terms from geometric mixing rule
